{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず！\nかなりんぺろぺろっ！\nぺろんちょっ！\nぺろぺろぺろ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"訳:かなりんお誕生日おめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にかかなりんは１９歳になっておりました。\nかなりんのお肌好き\n腕好き\n足好き\nすべすべ〜すべすべ〜\n最初はボディタッチ嫌がっていたかなりんも今はすっかり慣れて生駒にさわらせてくれる！\nかなりんありがとう！\nこれからもよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\nかなりんぺろぺろ〜\n実際にぺろぺろしてみた。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒は舌が実は凄く短いんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/08/08/6920016/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんファンのみなさんごめんねっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで！\n乃木坂46初の！\nファースト写真集の撮影してきました！\n日焼けした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも凄く素敵な物になると思います！\nこりゃあスタンばってないとね！\n発売をお楽しみにっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。\n生駒は洗濯がありますので！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}